            <ArticleTitle>Coronary vasculitis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>265-71</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Although patients with immune system dysfunction leading to MI may be a small subpopulation, they present an interesting challenge. Early recognition of their condition and prompt anti-inflammatory therapy, along with modification of cardiac rehabilitation and teaching protocols, will promote favorable long-term outcomes.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
